      ],
      "source": "https://www.dreamlandvilla.org/page.cfm/2669"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 1978 residents opposed Mesa annexation, and by 1979 eighty percent backed a county senior‑citizen zoning area.",
